description	"The Sniper

The Ultimate Sniper.

^2Weaponry:
- Disruptor Rifle (3)
- Special Projectile Rifle
- Amban Pulse-Phase Blaster (2)

^8Attributes:
- Bioscan Visor (3)
- Regenerating Armor (3)
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- 6 Tracking Darts ^3[CS2 Melee]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gun Kick ^3[CS3]

^2Strengths^7: Very good at range. The Projectile Rifle has 3 shots and travels to the target instantly, the Disruptor Rifle can pierce through cover, the Amban Blaster has a stun baton attachment for close range combat.
^1Weaknesses^7: Vulnerable in melee / short range combat."